# Enterprise form & grid layout (Settings)

**Locked by:** `MOB-EXECUTE-MASTER-SETTINGS-GRID-AND-RULES-V4`  
**Also in:** root `.cursorrules` (ENTERPRISE FORM & GRID LAYOUT RULES)

## Must

- Multi-field forms on wide screens: East-to-West CSS Grid  
  `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;`
- Field wrappers: `display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;` (label above input)
- Inputs/selects/textareas: `width: 100%; max-width: 420px;` (never infinite stretch)
- Readiness/status rows: `display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;`
- Never modify/delete `id`, `data-*`, or `onclick`

## Must not

- Single massive vertical column of form fields on wide screens
- Overlapping labels/inputs
- `height: 100vh` / forced empty scroll on Settings content wrappers for “layout polish”
